  + candidate production modules at most one after signature
  + candidate lib exports at most one after signature
  + dependencies zero
  + effects zero
  + lineage cardinality exactly two
  + evidence grades exactly one requested value and one ClaimOnly provenance grade
  + open runtime, producer, issuer, and consumer types zero

